"optionIdx":10}]},{"name":"Summer Rental","desc":"Jay McDermott’s work primarily explores the graphic qualities of hard edged abstraction. He is concerned with the formal aspects of a painting - color, gesture, shape, balance, and line - which guide the piece into something he could not have fully planned. Each painting evolves through a kind of conversation, where emotion anchors the work but rarely in a singular way. Images shift, overlap, and settle into forms that are often abstract. Human figures sometimes appear, with some ambiguity of interpretation. Abstraction allows him to hold onto that ambiguity. It creates space for both himself and the viewer to engage more freely, to find meaning that is not fixed but felt. Ultimately, the","photo":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55c8de25e4b0672c6266bf8f/acdd36d4-4e2d-4ce3-92f7-020e0412261b/Screenshot+2026-05-28+223635.png","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":950,"per":"/group","optionIdx":11}]},{"name":"Fishburn Court","desc":null,"photo":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55c8de25e4b0672c6266bf8f/1508424320768-C7TG7GTS3Q9UKSI8DWOA/Carney_Fishburn_Court.JPG","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":1500,"per":"/group","optionIdx":12}]},{"name":"Deep Dive","desc":null,"photo":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55c8de25e4b0672c6266bf8f/1729271702756-TLFIW85LY6AJ7N4VFOI7/944C9D1A-0ED3-48AD-9029-76B113DD2E81.jpeg","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":2100,"per":"/group","optionIdx":13}]}],"includes":[],"addons":[],"gap":"Prices, hours and eligibility are not copied here yet. We will ask when you request.","blurb":"Four Eleven Gallery is proud to be a founding member of the Provincetown Art Gallery Association! Over 25 art galleries are working together to bring awareness of the vibrant art community in Provincetown.","photos":[],"ytVideos":[],"lat":42.0547087,"lon":-70.1817022,"tags":["A Putting to Flight","Fishburn Court","NYC Night","Thom’s Treehouse View","Summer Camp","Dru